<speak>Perhaps the easiest starting point is the journey of the envelope rather than the contents. For example, personal post could stay unopened and go into one clearly labelled tray for you to collect, rather than being placed among business documents. That would not require your staff to make judgments about what matters most. On our side, we can discuss your preferred correspondence channel and keep any actual profile maintenance within the normal administrative process. I am not changing your contact details during this chat. I would first like to hear what would be convenient for your ordinary day-to-day routine.</speak>